    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Did you live here before studying abroad in Victoria?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Even though I've heard that both you and Mister Wei were born to Yan aristocrats, it's really quite astonishing to see a mansion this big."
